Description: policy-based assessment client for MCPwn deployments
 mcpwn-red records deployment probe observations and assesses an explicit
 operator allow/deny policy, exporting evidence and incomplete coverage.
 YAML probes observe tool registration rather than command execution.
 Tool response text alone does not establish execution or isolation failure.
 .
 Undeclared policy rules and inconclusive observations remain UNKNOWN.
 This tool does not certify deployment safety.
